{"id": "en-1", "lang": "en", "text": "The DLR Earth Observation Center in Oberpfaffenhofen, near Munich, processes Sentinel-2 scenes of the Ammersee and the rest of Bavaria.", "toponyms": [{"start": 36, "end": 52, "text": "Oberpfaffenhofen", "lat": 48.083, "lon": 11.277}, {"start": 59, "end": 65, "text": "Munich", "lat": 48.1351, "lon": 11.582}, {"start": 102, "end": 110, "text": "Ammersee", "lat": 47.997, "lon": 11.12}, {"start": 127, "end": 134, "text": "Bavaria", "lat": 48.7904, "lon": 11.4979}]}
{"id": "en-2", "lang": "en", "text": "After the cyclone, relief teams travelled from Chennai to Madurai and Kanchipuram, while analysts in Hyderabad mapped flood extents across Tamil Nadu.", "toponyms": [{"start": 47, "end": 54, "text": "Chennai", "lat": 13.0827, "lon": 80.2707}, {"start": 58, "end": 65, "text": "Madurai", "lat": 9.9252, "lon": 78.1198}, {"start": 70, "end": 81, "text": "Kanchipuram", "lat": 12.8342, "lon": 79.7036}, {"start": 101, "end": 110, "text": "Hyderabad", "lat": 17.385, "lon": 78.4867}, {"start": 139, "end": 149, "text": "Tamil Nadu", "lat": 11.1271, "lon": 78.6569}]}
{"id": "en-3", "lang": "en", "text": "The storm passed over Paris, Texas, about 160 km north-east of Dallas.", "toponyms": [{"start": 22, "end": 27, "text": "Paris", "lat": 33.6609, "lon": -95.5555}, {"start": 29, "end": 34, "text": "Texas", "lat": 31.9686, "lon": -99.9018}, {"start": 63, "end": 69, "text": "Dallas", "lat": 32.7767, "lon": -96.797}]}
{"id": "de-1", "lang": "de", "text": "Das Deutsche Zentrum für Luft- und Raumfahrt hat seinen Hauptsitz in Köln und betreibt Standorte in Berlin, Braunschweig und Oberpfaffenhofen.", "toponyms": [{"start": 69, "end": 73, "text": "Köln", "lat": 50.9375, "lon": 6.9603}, {"start": 100, "end": 106, "text": "Berlin", "lat": 52.52, "lon": 13.405}, {"start": 108, "end": 120, "text": "Braunschweig", "lat": 52.2689, "lon": 10.5268}, {"start": 125, "end": 141, "text": "Oberpfaffenhofen", "lat": 48.083, "lon": 11.277}]}
{"id": "de-2", "lang": "de", "text": "Das Hochwasser an der Oder erreichte Frankfurt und Słubice; Brandenburg rief den Katastrophenfall aus.", "toponyms": [{"start": 22, "end": 26, "text": "Oder", "lat": null, "lon": null}, {"start": 37, "end": 46, "text": "Frankfurt", "lat": 52.3471, "lon": 14.5506}, {"start": 51, "end": 58, "text": "Słubice", "lat": 52.35, "lon": 14.56}, {"start": 60, "end": 71, "text": "Brandenburg", "lat": 52.4125, "lon": 12.5316}]}
{"id": "ta-1", "lang": "ta", "text": "சென்னையில் பெய்த கனமழையால் மதுரை மற்றும் கோயம்புத்தூர் பகுதிகளில் வெள்ளம் ஏற்பட்டது.", "toponyms": [{"start": 0, "end": 10, "text": "சென்னையில்", "lat": 13.0827, "lon": 80.2707}, {"start": 27, "end": 32, "text": "மதுரை", "lat": 9.9252, "lon": 78.1198}, {"start": 41, "end": 54, "text": "கோயம்புத்தூர்", "lat": 11.0168, "lon": 76.9558}]}
{"id": "ta-2", "lang": "ta", "text": "இஸ்ரோ ஸ்ரீஹரிகோட்டாவிலிருந்து செயற்கைக்கோளை ஏவியது; பெங்களூரில் உள்ள கட்டுப்பாட்டு மையம் அதைக் கண்காணித்தது.", "toponyms": [{"start": 6, "end": 29, "text": "ஸ்ரீஹரிகோட்டாவிலிருந்து", "lat": 13.7331, "lon": 80.235}, {"start": 52, "end": 63, "text": "பெங்களூரில்", "lat": 12.9716, "lon": 77.5946}]}
{"id": "hi-1", "lang": "hi", "text": "भारी बारिश के कारण मुंबई और पुणे में बाढ़ आ गई, जबकि महाराष्ट्र सरकार ने राहत कार्य शुरू किया।", "toponyms": [{"start": 19, "end": 24, "text": "मुंबई", "lat": 19.076, "lon": 72.8777}, {"start": 28, "end": 32, "text": "पुणे", "lat": 18.5204, "lon": 73.8567}, {"start": 53, "end": 63, "text": "महाराष्ट्र", "lat": 19.6633, "lon": 75.3003}]}
{"id": "hi-2", "lang": "hi", "text": "इसरो का मुख्यालय बेंगलुरु में है और उपग्रह श्रीहरिकोटा से प्रक्षेपित किए जाते हैं; वाराणसी गंगा के तट पर स्थित है।", "toponyms": [{"start": 17, "end": 25, "text": "बेंगलुरु", "lat": 12.9716, "lon": 77.5946}, {"start": 43, "end": 54, "text": "श्रीहरिकोटा", "lat": 13.7331, "lon": 80.235}, {"start": 83, "end": 90, "text": "वाराणसी", "lat": 25.3176, "lon": 82.9739}, {"start": 91, "end": 95, "text": "गंगा", "lat": null, "lon": null}]}
